<title>USA: Advanced Tissue Dermagraft trial positive.</title>
<headline>Advanced Tissue Dermagraft trial positive.</headline>
<dateline>LA JOLLA, Calif. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Tissue Sciences Inc said Monday the pivotal trial of its Dermagraft treatment for diabetic foot ulcers showed it was &quot;significantly more effective&quot; than the current standard of care.</p>
<p>The company said that at the primary trial end point of 12 weeks, the patient group being treated with Dermagraft did 21 percent better than the control group.</p>
